		<notes>
			<note>This is a reprint with minor edits of the Pigott Hoyles, specifically </note>
			<note url="pigott.3.3.xml">Pigott.3.3</note>
			<note>, as it has some of the games that appear in the appendix there after the section on the Statute Laws of Gaming. Walker includes Loo, Lottery, Reversis and Speculation, while omitting Domino, Commerce, and Vingt-un.</note>
			<note rend="paragraph"/>
			<note>Some copies (CSmH, NjP, Levy) retain the original wrappers showing a price of 3s.</note>
		</notes>
